  "body": "## What is owed\n\nPR #1798 (the report door, issue #1696) changed the UI. Its body has no before and after screenshots. The maintainer waived them for the merge and ordered this follow-up.\n\nSource: finding 3 of the review of PR #1798 at head `40d967840026f5cf2193d2d68537efcc4895bcae` (comment 7004545700).\n\n## What to do\n\n1. Start the application from `main` with an empty project. Do not use a project of the user.\n2. Take one screenshot of the report door with its two buttons, and one of the status line after a report.\n3. Add the two screenshots in a comment on PR #1798.\n4. Close this issue with a link to that comment.\n\nRefs #1696\n",
